<Base lang="en" title="Privacy — TailorMind">
  <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
  <p>This notice describes how TailorMind handles personal data submitted through this hiring site. Compliance reference: Peru Personal Data Protection Law (Ley N.° 29733) and its regulation.</p>

  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>TailorMind — contact: <a href="mailto:billy@tailormind.io">billy@tailormind.io</a>.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Identity: full name, email, phone, country/city.</li>
    <li>Professional: CV, LinkedIn URL, portfolio URL, self-reported experience.</li>
    <li>Process artifacts: take-home submissions, interview notes, scores.</li>
    <li>Site events: compensation-reveal event (email + timestamp).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>Evaluating your candidacy for the role you applied to. We do not sell, share, or use the data for unrelated marketing.</p>

  <h2>Legal basis</h2>
  <p>Your explicit consent at form submission, plus our legitimate interest in evaluating candidates for an open position.</p>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>Application data is retained for <strong>12 months</strong> after the process closes, then deleted, unless you ask earlier or consent to a longer retention for future roles.</p>

  <h2>Your rights (ARCO + revocation)</h2>
  <p>You may request access, rectification, cancellation, opposition, or revocation of consent at any time by writing to <a href="mailto:billy@tailormind.io">billy@tailormind.io</a>.</p>

  <h2>Storage</h2>
  <p>Data is stored in Google Workspace (Drive, Sheets, Gmail) under our organization account.</p>
</Base>
